[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7620.99, "timestamp": "02:07:00", "text": "上传速度就像 1 比 1 一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7625.189, "timestamp": "02:07:05", "text": "呃，就像我不能在YouTube上直播一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7628.55, "timestamp": "02:07:08", "text": "它的比特率会一直停留在1000左右。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7631.51, "timestamp": "02:07:11", "text": "不会再多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7634.589, "timestamp": "02:07:14", "text": "然后我就想，“好吧，要么是a，要么是b。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7638.55, "timestamp": "02:07:18", "text": "gio。”因为呃，我想我爸爸，是的，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7640.55, "timestamp": "02:07:20", "text": "爸爸有一张地理模拟卡。所以我就想，“好吧，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7643.43, "timestamp": "02:07:23", "text": "咱们就用地源光纤吧。”所以从那时起"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7645.75, "timestamp": "02:07:25", "text": "我一直有胃食管反流病。我想试试"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7648.229, "timestamp": "02:07:28", "text": "虽然我听说了这件事，但还是想问问。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7649.709, "timestamp": "02:07:29", "text": "真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7652.95, "timestamp": "02:07:32", "text": "好的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7655.91, "timestamp": "02:07:35", "text": "我的意思是，是的。我记得那些日子……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7661.35, "timestamp": "02:07:41", "text": "获得 200 KB PS。哦，是的。我当时就是我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7663.189, "timestamp": "02:07:43", "text": "就像快要疯了一样。我当时就想，这他妈到底是怎么回事？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7667.109, "timestamp": "02:07:47", "text": "速度真快？为什么速度这么快？哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7669.51, "timestamp": "02:07:49", "text": "上帝。我可以下载任何东西，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7671.75, "timestamp": "02:07:51", "text": "现在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7675.709, "timestamp": "02:07:55", "text": "比如 200 kbps。我当时就想，“我的天哪”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7679.35, "timestamp": "02:07:59", "text": "“妈的，也太快了吧。”"}]